  "goodToKnow": "Der Klassenerhalt means staying in your league, avoiding relegation: um den Klassenerhalt kämpfen. In the Bundesliga, the bottom two teams go down (der Abstieg), and the 16th-placed team plays two Relegation matches against the third-placed team from the 2. Bundesliga. Der Aufstieg is promotion, and der Abstiegskampf the relegation battle. Die Klasse here means division or league. It has no plural."
